  "description": "Lee Shin-Jae, a salesman who makes a living with his looks, impulsively starts dating Seo Nan-Yeong, a kind and wealthy student from a prestigious university. However, unable to break his bad habit of going through relationships like they’re disposable, he breaks up with him, only to wake up the very next day, naked and tied up in a strange place.\n\n *“To be honest, I’m not exactly a prince who’s good at playing house either. If you found me boring… then I guess I should just call it quits.”*\n\nHis boyfriend, who had always seemed perfect, harbored a cruel secret… \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
